Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 14:26:17 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] feat: add /kroger pull to export purchase-history.json via
 CDP

Attach to a logged-in kroger.com/mypurchases Chrome tab on 127.0.0.1:9222
and overwrite local JSON history. No credentials, cookies, or agent tool.
